                "headline": "High Wind Warning issued November 24 at 11:37AM AKST until November 25 at 9:00AM AKST by NWS Anchorage AK",
                "description": "* WHAT...South winds 40 to 60 mph with gusts up to 75 mph expected.\n\n* WHERE...Shemya and Attu Islands.\n\n* WHEN...From 1 AM to 9 AM AKST Wednesday.\n\n* IMPACTS...High winds may move loose debris, damage property, and\ncause power outages. Travel will be difficult.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...The strongest winds are expected between 5 and\n8 AM AKST Wednesday morning, with winds decreasing, but remaining\nfairly gusty after 9 AM.",
                "instruction": "People are urged to secure loose objects that could be blown around\nor damaged by the wind. Prepare for the possibility of widespread\npower outages. Use caution if you must drive.",
